      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently VRCX has a setting that does this for when you crash, but having a native option, even if it's just a modification of the \"You Are Here\" tag to say \"Last Visited,\" assuming the instance still exists, would help. Especially when you want to avoid going back whence you came due to too many trolls or something.",
